%% title: State diagram
%% summary: Lifecycles and transitions — a deployment from queued to done.
%% updated: 2026-10-07
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Queued
  Queued --> Building: runner free
  Building --> Canary: image pushed
  Building --> Failed: tests red
  Canary --> Live: SLO holds
  Canary --> RolledBack: SLO breached
  Failed --> Queued: retry
  Live --> [*]
  RolledBack --> [*]
